      "text": "🤖 AI Agent A plan-and-execute agent decomposes goals into steps across Ollama, OpenAI, Anthropic, and DeepSeek — with approvals for sensitive actions. 🧩 Plugins (.fyp) Isolated .fyp packages — a JSON-RPC worker plus a micro-frontend UI — installable from the marketplace as capabilities the Agent can call. 📜 Skills (.fys) Codex-style progressive-disclosure skills (.fys) that give the Agent on-demand domain knowledge and procedures for each business scenario. 🖥️ Cross-Platform The same Vue UI runs in a browser or an Electron desktop window on Windows, macOS, and Linux. The headless backend b",
